 "remarks": "Stylish Colonial with modern comfort. Sun filled home with breathtaking views of Long Island Sound. This is a true all year-round vacation living. Impeccably maintained with open-concept living, dining, kitchen area, a perfect place for all year living and entertaining. It features 5 bedrooms and 3 full baths. Updated and steps away from private beach (Best kept secret with 4 acres of association grounds including a private sandy beach). Enjoy and appreciate the exceptional natural beauty from the decks and balconies. Let's not forget the awesome sunrise and sunset views. A cozy studio apt. or perfect home office with full bath offers slider to a wonderful garage top terrace. Very close to nearby beaches, parks and tennis courts. Minutes to downtown and Train Station. Excellent credit and job history. Photos from previous occupant. No pets, no smoking. 2 month's security.  Agent-co-owner.",
